(5659710, 822406, 103032, '<td valign="top">Like the concept, but I think the image may have been stronger if the setting sun was directly behind the couple''s heads instead of being off to the left; so you may have positioned the couple to your left a step or you may have stepped over to your right a bit.  IMO.  Good luck on the voting.</td>', 'Like the concept, but I think the image may have been stronger if the setting sun was directly behind the couple''s heads instead of being off to the left; so you may have positioned the couple to your left a step or you may have stepped over to your right a bit.  IMO.  Good luck on the voting.', '2009-09-23 17:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
