(5659729, 822827, 103032, '<td valign="top">I like the shot, meets the challenge.  With that said, if you''ve been on DPC for any amount of time, you may get critiques (and dinged) for the horizon not being level, and the sailboat in the background being a distraction.  I think a few things may have improved this image; correct the tilt, and perhaps crop so that the couple fills more of the frame, and maybe wait for the boat to pass by.  Good luck on the voting.</td>', 'I like the shot, meets the challenge.  With that said, if you''ve been on DPC for any amount of time, you may get critiques (and dinged) for the horizon not being level, and the sailboat in the background being a distraction.  I think a few things may have improved this image; correct the tilt, and perhaps crop so that the couple fills more of the frame, and maybe wait for the boat to pass by.  Good luck on the voting.', '2009-09-23 17:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
