(5660484, 822832, 44825, '<td valign="top">How is this a hug or a kiss - DNMC</td>', 'How is this a hug or a kiss - DNMC', '2009-09-24 09:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5660486, 823089, 44825, '<td valign="top">I like the composition but the subjects look a little blown out</td>', 'I like the composition but the subjects look a little blown out', '2009-09-24 09:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5660487, 822230, 44825, '<td valign="top">Don''t see hugs or kisses here</td>', 'Don''t see hugs or kisses here', '2009-09-24 09:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5660541, 821988, 62187, '<td valign="top">Well, it''s not the traditional idea of ''Hug and Kiss''. Neither is my photo and it''s getting hammered even though I think the photo is technically sound: as your is but yours is better. My photo is at 4.5: down from 5.7 and up from 4. So, how do I score your photo? It''s a 10 all the way.</td>', 'Well, it''s not the traditional idea of ''Hug and Kiss''. Neither is my photo and it''s getting hammered even though I think the photo is technically sound: as your is but yours is better. My photo is at 4.5: down from 5.7 and up from 4. So, how do I score your photo? It''s a 10 all the way.', '2009-09-24 11:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5660543, 823122, 62187, '<td valign="top">I don''t know why but I get the feeling from this photo that somebody is getting squeezed very tight rather then hugged. No matter, it''s an awesome photo and has that ''HDR'' look to it. 9</td>', 'I don''t know why but I get the feeling from this photo that somebody is getting squeezed very tight rather then hugged. No matter, it''s an awesome photo and has that ''HDR'' look to it. 9', '2009-09-24 11:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5660546, 822972, 62187, '<td valign="top">Kids kissing kinda creeps me out. It certainly meets the challenge and the photo is technically perfect as far as I can see. I have no choice but to score it at 10 and I''m sure it will be in the top 10 if not a ribbon winner.</td>', 'Kids kissing kinda creeps me out. It certainly meets the challenge and the photo is technically perfect as far as I can see. I have no choice but to score it at 10 and I''m sure it will be in the top 10 if not a ribbon winner.', '2009-09-24 11:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5660547, 822521, 62187, '<td valign="top">To me, the photo has a kind of faded look - it works very well though I think. I''ll bet your photo scores high. I''ll try to help with a 9.</td>', 'To me, the photo has a kind of faded look - it works very well though I think. I''ll bet your photo scores high. I''ll try to help with a 9.', '2009-09-24 11:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5660548, 822412, 62187, '<td valign="top">I don''t have much to offer photographically. The capture is very touching and I hope your photo scores very high - I''m sure it will be in the top 10 at least. 9</td>', 'I don''t have much to offer photographically. The capture is very touching and I hope your photo scores very high - I''m sure it will be in the top 10 at least. 9', '2009-09-24 11:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5660550, 822727, 62187, '<td valign="top">I''m not a fan of centered subjects but it seems like it was probably best for this shot. I like the more ''spontaneous'' look this has rather then the ''posed'' look some of the other similar shots offered for the challenge. I do think there could be a little more contrast as to me, the photo looks a little faded. The focus is excellent. I''ll score the photo at 9.</td>', 'I''m not a fan of centered subjects but it seems like it was probably best for this shot. I like the more ''spontaneous'' look this has rather then the ''posed'' look some of the other similar shots offered for the challenge. I do think there could be a little more contrast as to me, the photo looks a little faded. The focus is excellent. I''ll score the photo at 9.', '2009-09-24 11:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5660553, 823076, 62187, '<td valign="top">I waited ''till last to score/comment this photo. I was hoping by waiting, that when I came back to vote, she''d have aged about 30 years or so. That way I could offer a photo of myself to put in the frame ;&gt;) This photo makes me feel so sad and it has a great emotive feel to it. Photographically it is very sound. I think maybe the focus could be a little bit crisper. The photo is my pick for the blue: 10</td>', 'I waited ''till last to score/comment this photo. I was hoping by waiting, that when I came back to vote, she''d have aged about 30 years or so. That way I could offer a photo of myself to put in the frame ;>) This photo makes me feel so sad and it has a great emotive feel to it. Photographically it is very sound. I think maybe the focus could be a little bit crisper. The photo is my pick for the blue: 10', '2009-09-24 11:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5660612, 822793, 10785, '<td valign="top">Nice use of slow shutter speed to show the motion blur. Combine that with the shallow DOF to blur the background and the focus of the shot lands right on the womans face where all the emotion lies! Excellent!</td>', 'Nice use of slow shutter speed to show the motion blur. Combine that with the shallow DOF to blur the background and the focus of the shot lands right on the womans face where all the emotion lies! Excellent!', '2009-09-24 12:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5660626, 822832, 10785, '<td valign="top">Points for humor, but DNMC. You could have showed this off in the forums instead of wasting a challenge entry. Now if the challenge was Man Boobs, then I would''ve voted 10!</td>', 'Points for humor, but DNMC. You could have showed this off in the forums instead of wasting a challenge entry. Now if the challenge was Man Boobs, then I would''ve voted 10!', '2009-09-24 13:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5660627, 822616, 10785, '<td valign="top">THis tells a good story.</td>', 'THis tells a good story.', '2009-09-24 13:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5660630, 823000, 10785, '<td valign="top">Very good concept. The image is flat and either out of focus or blurred due to being hand held at slow shutter speed. The colors are not very complementary either</td>', 'Very good concept. The image is flat and either out of focus or blurred due to being hand held at slow shutter speed. The colors are not very complementary either', '2009-09-24 13:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5660632, 823098, 10785, '<td valign="top">This one has a bit more depth than your friend''s shot of the lips on yellow paper. You also focused well. I''ll give you an E for effort.</td>', 'This one has a bit more depth than your friend''s shot of the lips on yellow paper. You also focused well. I''ll give you an E for effort.', '2009-09-24 13:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5660794, 822999, 45790, '<td valign="top">Would be better if foreground kisses were in focus rather than background kisses.</td>', 'Would be better if foreground kisses were in focus rather than background kisses.', '2009-09-24 16:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
