(5663272, 821718, 62187, '<td valign="top">Wow, I am so done with babies! but I don''t expect others to have my views. Your photo is socially touching and the composition is nice. It''s downfall to me is the lighting. It looks like a flash was used (which I''ve never really found useful) or a bright spotlight. I think some softer lighting and longer exposure time might have alleviated that. But, it''s always hard to guess how to really help (but that is a personal taste situation too because you may love it how it is and that is totally ok with me) until we know the camera settings and/or photo editing process. I think the conversion to black and white was a good choice too.</td>', 'Wow, I am so done with babies! but I don''t expect others to have my views. Your photo is socially touching and the composition is nice. It''s downfall to me is the lighting. It looks like a flash was used (which I''ve never really found useful) or a bright spotlight. I think some softer lighting and longer exposure time might have alleviated that. But, it''s always hard to guess how to really help (but that is a personal taste situation too because you may love it how it is and that is totally ok with me) until we know the camera settings and/or photo editing process. I think the conversion to black and white was a good choice too.', '2009-09-26 12:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
