(5666091, 822166, 83313, '<td valign="top">Glad you were able to fit Clark into another challenge. This one is just too funny! I really do not want to know about the Clark''s dipstick, however.<br/> <br/>Added: This unashamed display of man-vehicle love deserves one of these. Collect the entire set, trade ''em with your friends!<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=737193" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/737193.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/737193.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/737193.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Glad you were able to fit Clark into another challenge. This one is just too funny! I really do not want to know about the Clark''s dipstick, however. Added: This unashamed display of man-vehicle love deserves one of these. Collect the entire set, trade ''em with your friends!', '2009-09-29 14:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5666094, 823010, 83313, '<td valign="top">The special feelings between a young woman and her staircase cannot be denied. Let society call it what it may, this will endure, because it is real. <br/> <br/>I had a special staircase once. Her name was Vicky. She was a very sexy and curvaceous spiral staircase. <br/><a href="//www.flickr.com/photos/yospiff/3757541130/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//farm4.static.flickr.com/3501/3757541130_ab23f870fb_t.jpg'', strrpos(''//farm4.static.flickr.com/3501/3757541130_ab23f870fb_t.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//farm4.static.flickr.com/3501/3757541130_ab23f870fb_t.jpg"/></a> <br/>She ran away with an Olympus owner. I still miss her deeply and I long for the cool, gentle feel of her handrail late at night.<br/> <br/>Added: This gets a shoehorn for injecting a little humor into a non-humorous challenge. Collect ''em all! Trade ''em with your friends! Recoil in horror at such a dubious honor!<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=737192" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/737192.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/737192.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/737192.jpg"/></a></td>', 'The special feelings between a young woman and her staircase cannot be denied. Let society call it what it may, this will endure, because it is real.  I had a special staircase once. Her name was Vicky. She was a very sexy and curvaceous spiral staircase.  She ran away with an Olympus owner. I still miss her deeply and I long for the cool, gentle feel of her handrail late at night. Added: This gets a shoehorn for injecting a little humor into a non-humorous challenge. Collect ''em all! Trade ''em with your friends! Recoil in horror at such a dubious honor!', '2009-09-29 14:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
