(5667444, 823076, 77672, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone for the great comments. Most I''ve gotten on an image. <br/> <br/>It placed about where I expected it to. I wasnt happy with the image cause I was so rushed taking it and editing it. I really wished I had gotten the wrinkes out of the background. Almost unsubmitted it a few times. Oh well...you live and learn :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'Thanks everyone for the great comments. Most I''ve gotten on an image.  It placed about where I expected it to. I wasnt happy with the image cause I was so rushed taking it and editing it. I really wished I had gotten the wrinkes out of the background. Almost unsubmitted it a few times. Oh well...you live and learn :) ', '2009-09-30 12:44:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(5667456, 822761, 31456, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Blackbox:</b></div><hr/><i>Kind of Voyeuristic which is a little creepy to me.</i></td></tr></table> <br/>Completely posed, actually. But I see why you''d think so - I expected candids to be common in the challenge, so I went with the most candid-looking one. Could''ve just set up a shot of me and my girlfriend, but I thought this would fare better.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Blackbox:</b></div><hr/><i>To me, the photo seems slightly dark.</i></td></tr></table> <br/>Yeah, I agree. It looked okay on the laptop, but not here on my girlfriend''s monitor. Next time, I''ll check the histogram before submitting.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Blackbox:</b></div><hr/><i>Or, it may just be my monitor!</i></td></tr></table> <br/>That could add to it. On my cousin''s monitor, it''s very low-key and saturated.<br/> <br/>Thanks for the 8; I think it''s more of a "5" or "6" image because of the darkness and weird composition, but your 8 helped offset the 1s and 2s.<br/> <br/>Edit: line spacing<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-09-30 11:54:39.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by Blackbox:Kind of Voyeuristic which is a little creepy to me. Completely posed, actually. But I see why you''d think so - I expected candids to be common in the challenge, so I went with the most candid-looking one. Could''ve just set up a shot of me and my girlfriend, but I thought this would fare better. Originally posted by Blackbox:To me, the photo seems slightly dark. Yeah, I agree. It looked okay on the laptop, but not here on my girlfriend''s monitor. Next time, I''ll check the histogram before submitting. Originally posted by Blackbox:Or, it may just be my monitor! That could add to it. On my cousin''s monitor, it''s very low-key and saturated. Thanks for the 8; I think it''s more of a "5" or "6" image because of the darkness and weird composition, but your 8 helped offset the 1s and 2s. Edit: line spacing', '2009-09-30 12:54:10.000000', '2009-09-30 12:54:39.000000', 0),
