(5671042, 823053, 104220, '<td valign="top">This message is posted after the competion closed:...<br/> <br/>I happen to quite like this picture but some of you feel the need to leave rude comments about it.. WHY..??<br/> <br/>Appreciative criticism doesn''t hurt and doesn''t cost anything to you.<br/> <br/>And in all fairness, I think it captures the moment rather well, although there is no kiss or a hug involved<br/>in this shot, it clearly demonstrates a connection between two people.<br/> <br/></td>', 'This message is posted after the competion closed:... I happen to quite like this picture but some of you feel the need to leave rude comments about it.. WHY..?? Appreciative criticism doesn''t hurt and doesn''t cost anything to you. And in all fairness, I think it captures the moment rather well, although there is no kiss or a hug involvedin this shot, it clearly demonstrates a connection between two people. ', '2009-10-02 07:47:18.000000', NULL, 0),
