(5674815, 823053, 104220, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Yo_Spiff:</b></div><hr/><i> An interesting candid. Maybe a little shoehorny, since it does not really illustrate a hug or kiss, but just the hope of one. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>The captions says it all NOT QUITE..!!! So why the shoehorny comment... Maybe you should read fully before stating.<br/> <br/>And to be honest, this site if a little pretentious to me. There are a LOT of good people on here but then there are a few others that lower the tone and they don''t even have a single clue about whats good or bad.<br/> <br/>The answer to this is that there is NO GOOD OR BAD.... Each images is GOOD for the taker of that image. The only one problem, which is probably where I went wrong, is that whether the image fits the competition.<br/> <br/>I failed this time round because I felt that this was a great Candid shot that did not need a hug or kiss. I interpreted the images with more of a TENSION of feelings associated with hugs and kisses.<br/> <br/>Sorry I got it wrong, but there is NO NEED to leave NASTY or UN-CONSTRUCTIVE comments......</td>', 'Originally posted by Yo_Spiff: An interesting candid. Maybe a little shoehorny, since it does not really illustrate a hug or kiss, but just the hope of one.   The captions says it all NOT QUITE..!!! So why the shoehorny comment... Maybe you should read fully before stating. And to be honest, this site if a little pretentious to me. There are a LOT of good people on here but then there are a few others that lower the tone and they don''t even have a single clue about whats good or bad. The answer to this is that there is NO GOOD OR BAD.... Each images is GOOD for the taker of that image. The only one problem, which is probably where I went wrong, is that whether the image fits the competition. I failed this time round because I felt that this was a great Candid shot that did not need a hug or kiss. I interpreted the images with more of a TENSION of feelings associated with hugs and kisses. Sorry I got it wrong, but there is NO NEED to leave NASTY or UN-CONSTRUCTIVE comments......', '2009-10-04 21:01:48.000000', NULL, 0),
